finding('F12','P2','Operational completeness is limited by unreviewed and client-service dependencies',[
 cite('de2d312169fc','ON_36/2026: exact Standard for Users X-TRM A2A and RNI mode and MT-X under-review folder'),cite('a7e4ccfb2933','Part 5 §§2–3: DCP user guidelines and local service requirements'),cite('410859953fce','Resolution 5 §2.2: DSS technical announcements'),cite('089b7aaef991','Chapter 4 and §7.1: notices and participant reports')],
 'A general T2S flow may be presented as an exact production X-TRM/DSS/MyVPS interface, or a regulatory duty as a complete onboarding/default/incident procedure.',
 'Use the coverage matrix and missing-source queue. Some public specifications are already archived but unreviewed; review those before requesting private access. Ask for market/access model/ISIN/date where needed and abstain on unverified production fields.')
