write('COVERAGE-MATRIX.md','# Question-based operational coverage\n\n13 September 2026. “Covered” means the bounded question can be answered from reviewed clauses, not that the whole service is complete or automatically admitted for retrieval. “Partial” includes authoritative documents already archived but not yet substantively reviewed; “missing” means the required proposition was not located in reviewed evidence; “access-restricted” is used only for identified MT-X dependencies. Other portal access is unverified. No row equates CSDR operator obligations with participant procedures. Oslo’s EEA/national legal applicability is not assumed.\n\n'+table(['ID','Entity / service','Role','Practical question','Required evidence / exact support','Status','Gap / qualification'],[[r['id'],r['entity_service'],r['role'],r['practical_question'],r['required_and_supporting_evidence'],r['status'],r['gap_or_condition']] for r in M])+'\n\nExclusions: exhaustive instrument-by-instrument tax advice, investor suitability, pricing quotations without service/volume inputs, and private production credentials. CCP/trading-venue rules and cash-bank contracts are included only as dependencies; no claim to have audited those businesses. No existing-service question was declared not applicable merely because the source was missing.\n')

E=[]
def ev(q,expected,refs,fail):E.append({'id':f'E{len(E)+1:02}','question':q,'expected_answer':expected,'required_citations':refs,'failure_conditions':fail,'execution_status':'NOT_RUN','retrieved_evidence':[],'actual_answer':None,'reason':'No retrieval application/index located. Expected answers are audit fixtures, not observed model results.'})
ev('For Milan, does “T2S matched” prove that securities and cash moved?','No. Matching verifies compatible instructions; settlement requires eligibility and resources. Under Milan Art 72, matching is SF2 irrevocability subject to Art 70(2) bilateral cancellation; SF3 is the cash debit or securities debit for FoP.',[cite('8719262f5e8b','Articles 69,70(2),72 PDF 50–51'),cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','PDF 267,303–304')],['Equates matched and settled','Says matching has no legal effect','Omits bilateral-cancellation qualification'])
ev('Can a Milan matched instruction always be cancelled unilaterally?','No. Art 70 distinguishes pre-match unilateral and post-match bilateral cancellation, with non-modifiable, market/CCP and CoSD qualifications.',[cite('8719262f5e8b','Article 70 PDF 50–51')],['Unconditional yes','Unconditional no cancellation of matched instructions','Drops CoSD/market restrictions'])
ev('Can instructions match before ISD, and does realignment generation move securities immediately?','Matching and generation can precede ISD under valid setup. Automatic realignment follows matching/validation of prematched instructions. Posting waits for eligibility, resources and linked settlement conditions.',[cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','PDF 267–268,303–304,373–375,753')],['Generation is settlement','Forbids all pre-ISD processing','Claims early matching guarantees cash'])
ev('Two T2S CSDs, both banks ICP, seller at issuer CSD and buyer at linked investor CSD: what messages flow?','Illustrate bank-to-CSD via their local interface; CSD-to-T2S sese.023; T2S-to-CSD status sese.024, realignment notification sese.032 to CSDs in chain, settlement confirmation sese.025. Local relays are not proven to use native schemas. Ask for link/configuration for a production mapping.',[cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','PDF 753,778,373–376'),cite('dd1cf7cb930b','§1.1 PDF 7')],['Bank ICP connects directly by assumption','Reverses direction of sese.032','Presents unverified X-TRM mapping as native T2S'])
ev('Does a valid ECB DCP certificate alone admit me to Copenhagen settlement?','No. The sampled Part 5 requires the local DCP service relationship/entitlements and User Guidelines/local conditions in addition to certification.',[cite('a7e4ccfb2933','§§2–3 PDF 2–3')],['Certificate replaces CSD membership','Ignores local testing/service conditions'])
ev('In Milan, is a participant with a settlement cash agent exempt from having a securities account?','No. Art 60 requires the securities account separately from DCA access or a cash agent; DCP adds further requirements.',[cite('8719262f5e8b','Article 60 PDF 44–45')],['Cash agent replaces securities account','Conflates securities participant and central-bank cash bank'])
ev('For the current T2S baseline, is NTS at 19:30 and are there two partial windows?','No: R2026.JUN Table 37 gives 20:00 and PDF 162 five windows. Current-linked Milan instructions conflict; flag and quarantine their timetable, and check local/daily notices before operational use.',[cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','PDF 160,162'),cite('dd1cf7cb930b','PDF 13,15'),cite('milan-it-settlement','PDF 12,15')],['Silently chooses Milan older clock','Conceals conflict','Assumes English translation alone caused it'])
ev('What was the announced EUR DvP cut-off on 8 September 2026?','The 15:30 ECB notice postponed it from 16:00 to 17:00 for that day. It is not a permanent timetable amendment; consult later updates for actual incidents.',[cite('t2s-2026-status-events','8 September 2026, 15:30 update')],['Answers 16:00 from normal schedule','Applies 17:00 to all future days'])
ev('A Monday trade is T+2: does the Wednesday T2S business day first start Wednesday morning?','Not necessarily. Under the normal schedule it can open Tuesday evening at 18:45 after the previous business day ends; NTS begins at 20:00 under the current baseline. Holidays, service and incident conditions matter.',[cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','PDF 160,163,165,168')],['Conflates trade/calendar/business/settlement date','Guarantees exact start despite predecessor dependency','Omits assumed business-day calendar'])
ev('Is every EU securities trade required to use T+2 on 13 September 2026?','No. CSDR Art 5(2) sets a latest ISD for covered venue transactions and lists exceptions; Art 5(1) requires settlement on the agreed ISD. Do not extend it to every instrument/transaction.',[cite('02014R0909-20260117','Article 5(1)–(2)')],['T+2 mandatory for every transaction','Applies future T+1 early'])
ev('Is EU T+1 still a proposal, and when does it apply?','It is enacted in Regulation 2025/2075; application begins 11 October 2027. Distinguish entry into force from application.',[cite('32025R2075','Articles 1–2')],['Calls it only a draft','Applies in September 2026','Uses enactment as application date'])
ev('May I promote the November T2S UDFS because the final-publication target was 11 September?','No. Latest located live-hub note is still a draft; the target is not proof final publication or deployment. June final documents and June 14 deployment were verified.',[cite('7244cf50f753','PDF 1–2'),cite('c164d86ada8e','PDF 1–2'),cite('t2s-2026-status-events','14 June 2026 confirmation')],['Treats planned publication as fact','Says no final can exist anywhere','Promotes draft to current'])
ev('On 13 September, does the daily eligible ISIN sheet prove BE0003809267’s new designated CSD is already operational?','No. Introduction and column headers distinguish data through 10 September from designated/alternative places as of 21 September. The sample current-place cell says Euroclear Belgium and future designated cell Euronext Securities. This is not a complete operational eligibility assertion.',[cite('ac385b0f3106','Introduction B5:B8; Equities A2/I2/K2/L2')],['Uses K2 as current','Ignores listing/currency scope','Infers all Milan securities'])
ev('Can the Convergence v1.6 flow establish the current Athens production interface?','No. It is programme design. Use current Athens rules/technical announcements for DSS; T2S documents describe native platform mechanics only where applicable.',[cite('625e85423963','Programme hub'),cite('71233aed41e7','Programme identity'),cite('410859953fce','§2.2 PDF 4–5')],['Uses future design as current local authority','Assumes all five CSDs share one present platform'])
ev('Does the Athens “Amendment 8” hub label prove a conflict with the seven-amendment PDF?','No such operative conflict was established. The Greek hub says Edition 8; both sampled documents list seven amendments. Edition count including original is a plausible explanation, explicitly an inference. Seventh amendment effectiveness is stated as 8 December 2025.',[cite('d89c56df8c5a','PDF 2,217 Section XIII Part 9'),cite('athens-greek-master','PDF 2,206')],['Invents an eighth amendment','Claims independent HCMC approval was fetched','Treats inference as legal proof'])
ev('Can we remove the Oslo subject-to-approval warning because Finanstilsynet approved VPO NOK?','No. System approval is distinct from approval of the September 2024 edition; English and Norwegian covers both retain the qualification.',[cite('14dc34b8e54e','PDF 1'),cite('822d46bb9149','PDF 1'),cite('1ee1619da83d','Infrastructure page')],['Conflates system and edition approval','Ignores governing-language reservation'])
ev('Does an Oslo substitute liquidity bank have the primary bank’s mandatory funding duty?','The sampled §§9–10 distinguish primary declarations from a substitute declaration that does not itself impose a duty to provide cash. Qualify the answer by the unresolved edition approval.',[cite('14dc34b8e54e','PDF 17–18, §§9–10')],['Says identical unconditional duties','Omits approval qualification'])
ev('What fee applies to a Copenhagen trade on 20 September versus 20 November 2026?','January and November fee-book periods differ. Identify service, participant role and charging basis, then inspect the exact tariff/conditions; this audit did not validate numeric fee rows.',[cite('14e2c64da9a0','PDF 1–2'),cite('cdd34eb011e9','PDF 1–2')],['Uses July publication as November effective date','Invents a numeric price','No clarification of service/date'])
ev('Are Copenhagen VP and T2S business-day boundaries the same?','The reviewed §2.2 distinguishes VP at 18:00 and T2S at 18:45. Service/currency calendars still control applicability.',[cite('3d76a327339b','§2.2 PDF 3')],['One universal group boundary','Drops route/currency qualifier'])
ev('Does Porto DCP replace the legal relationship with INTERBOLSA?','No. Regulation 1/2016 Art 2(4) keeps the relationship with INTERBOLSA; direct connectivity is technical.',[cite('fcbc69b0fc35','Article 2(4) PDF 2'),cite('089b7aaef991','PDF 17')],['ECB replaces local contract','Conflates technical and legal participation'])
ev('What are Porto daily reconciliation/report families for a participant?','§7.1 describes daily reconciliation and positions/activity reports; examples include MT535/MT536 and subscribed T2S reports for DCP. Exact schema/version/subscription needs the local layouts.',[cite('089b7aaef991','§7.1 PDF 66'),cite('67c9ce673c2a','Public layout candidate')],['Exact schema invented','Ignores report subscription/access model','Copies apparent source message typo as production instruction'])
ev('Is Porto completely closed on 1 May 2026?','The official 2026 calendar page expressly says FoP settlement is open that day. It references Notice 25/1162; consult that notice for binding scope.',[cite('porto-working-hours','2026 calendar, May 1 exception')],['Assumes cash holiday closes all securities processing','Treats webpage as entire calendar rulebook'])
ev('Do Athens EUR and non-EUR settlement cash arrangements use the same bank and account?','No general equivalence. Resolution 5 distinguishes EUR TARGET-GR arrangements from non-EUR arrangements; request currency and settlement-bank setup for a concrete answer.',[cite('410859953fce','§§1.1–1.2 PDF 3–4')],['Invents universal EUR DCA flow','Ignores non-EUR branch'])
ev('Does Athens staff certification mean every participant must have the same CSA requirements without exceptions?','No. Resolution 2 §1 lists exceptions; §2.1 sets a minimum certified CSA staffing requirement for the relevant participants and continuing competence.',[cite('513a8da7c0ad','§§1–2.1 PDF 2')],['Drops exceptions','Equates staff with technical certification'])
ev('Is daily issue reconciliation a duty only on the participant?','No. CSDR Art 37 imposes issue-integrity reconciliation on the CSD with cooperation where relevant; local participant reconciliation obligations are separate.',[cite('02014R0909-20260117','Article 37'),cite('089b7aaef991','§7.1 PDF 66')],['Misattributes CSD legal duty','Infers every local participant procedure from Article 37'])
ev('Who must offer omnibus and individual client segregation?','Article 38 distinguishes CSD account capabilities from the participant’s offer to clients; preserve paragraph 5 national-law qualification and paragraph 6 disclosure duties. Local account implementation requires local evidence.',[cite('02014R0909-20260117','Article 38(1)–(6)')],['Conflates operator/participant','Claims identical national account models'])
ev('Give an exact English quote from DORA using the archived English-labelled consolidated capture.','Do not treat the French body as an English quotation. Use the fetched English OJ version, cite the actual article, and keep any translation labelled. CSDs are included in Art 2(1)(g); Art 64 applies from 17 January 2025.',[cite('02022R2554-20221227','Articles 2,64 French body'),cite('dora-english-oj','Articles 2(1)(g),64')],['Silent translation presented as verbatim','Language inferred only from URL'])
ev('Give the complete production matching-field list from the current plain-text extraction.','Abstain from completeness until Diagram 55 is structured/validated. The PDF includes a payment-type-sensitive matrix absent from text. Retain additional/optional-field matching conditions and footnote 194 case sensitivity.',[cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','PDF 269 Diagram 55, footnote 194')],['Claims caption is full extraction','Invents missing schema','Drops cash/FoP conditions'])
ev('What is INTERBOLSA’s LEI? Can I join directly on the ESMA cell?','ESMA C25 is truncated and unsuitable as a canonical join key. A separately captured official MyInterbolsa page corroborates 529900LG70TCAGWCXT47; preserve both values and provenance, and note GLEIF not checked.',[cite('535f6a23062a','Authorised CSDs C25'),'SOURCE-RELATIONSHIPS.json esma-lei; official MyInterbolsa page'],['Silently edits raw source','Uses truncated key','Claims GLEIF verified'])
ev('Does the Milan July 2026 ESMA extension establish a new general settlement permission?','The sampled row identifies a UK stamp-duty ancillary-service extension. Do not broaden its legal scope or use it as a new settlement-authorisation date.',[cite('535f6a23062a','Authorised CSDs row 36')],['Converts tax extension to settlement permission','Ignores decision type'])
ev('Does the DvP 100-share/EUR1000 cross-CSD example prove an atomic swap of two different securities?','No. The reviewed example and realignment concern a securities-for-cash instruction/linked realignment. Ask for the two-security transaction structure and supported linkage/legal rules; abstain on guaranteed swap atomicity.',[cite('aa3d5a3b94c9','§§1.6.1.8 and 1.6.1.10, PDF 303–304,373–376')],['Infers security-for-security atomicity from DvP','Invents atomic contract semantics'])
ev('Which November X-TRM market identifier must I send now for Vorvel?','The 11 September notice announces changes from 30 November subject to successful testing and points to the MT-X Standard for Users X-TRM A2A and RNI mode. Exact identifier is not in reviewed public evidence; do not invent or apply it early.',[cite('de2d312169fc','ON_36/2026 PDF 1')],['Fabricates identifier','Ignores testing condition','Uses November identifier in September'])
ev('Do all changes in Commission C(2026)4640 apply on 7 December 2026?','No. Article 2 has a December default plus specified July 2027 and October 2027 exceptions. Cite the specific amendment point; OJ publication/entry into force was not independently verified.',[cite('591deafae0a9','Article 2')],['One date for every provision','Treats adoption as verified OJ publication','Claims already applicable on audit date'])
ev('Can the four-CSD corporate-events guide answer an Athens tax deadline?','No. The reviewed scope includes Milan, Porto, Copenhagen and Oslo. Obtain the Athens event/tax rule and investor facts; a group title is insufficient.',[cite('e1354fb2d76a','§2.3 PDF 17'),cite('b43be010e44f','Athens Resolution 8 candidate')],['Transfers group guide to Athens','Invents tax deadline','Uses unreviewed resolution as if read'])
